er” type"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, when she found out he wouldn’t be coming this year, she ended up coming to his house to see him. She prefers the protagonist, an older, kind, and mature adult ,over boys her own age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At school, she’s a member of the drama club. She has a promising future as a star, that you can see in her eyes. She fully immerses herself in her roles, and appears to drift into another world as she acts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Using her woman’s intuition, she feels a sense of rivalry toward Chinatsu and tries various ways to catch the protagonist’s attention, but her efforts gradually escalate."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c36987"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37e831ab4521db78a464084003219e7d0b88b6a21570419b65d43328f9fe6781.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0b132c4bb639c7e06304249f4b6ffb87ba4389465d9d5f301b1fe4730927a429.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北都 南","creatorId":"vndb:s113","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s113","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s113","name":"ひと美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:26666","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c40576","characterName":"向坂 つぼみ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c40576"},"originalCharacterName":"向坂 つぼみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8c85a30b2d4cb52f28d904bc866acc00ea9b9821b26b5a7d249728fc7611100f.webp","fallbackUrl